{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁一看到我们，就拿着竹扫帚，吧嗒吧嗒地向我们跑过来。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "安洁一看到我们，就拿着竹扫帚，吧嗒吧嗒地向我们跑过来。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「首先是隼太同学，欢迎回来！」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0690", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦～哈哈，果然安洁的问候让人神清气爽啊」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "「哦～哈哈，果然安洁的问候让人神清气爽啊」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0260", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦～安洁让您心情愉悦吗！」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0691", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，去各务台前绕个远果然是正确的啊。早上还是得有安洁才行～」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "「嗯，去各务台前绕个远果然是正确的啊。早上还是得有安洁才行～」", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0261", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看起来我就像是罐装咖啡之类的必备品呢」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0692", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁确实很能让人打起精神。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和隼太的迷之对话（？）结束后，安洁立刻转过身对樱乃说。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "和隼太的迷之对话（？）结束后，安洁立刻转过身对樱乃说。", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃同学也欢迎回来～」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0693", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早上好安洁。周五，过得很开心呢」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0670", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的！过得很开心呢～我一回想起来，身体就像是要蜕皮了一样兴奋」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「是的！过得很开心呢～我一回想起来，身体就像是要蜕皮了一样兴奋」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0694", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为是冬天，所以要注意皮肤保养哦」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0671", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我明白了。毕竟樱乃同学都这么说了，所以我会注意不要脱皮的」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "「我明白了。毕竟樱乃同学都这么说了，所以我会注意不要脱皮的」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0695", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0672", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「中午我还会找你来玩的」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0673", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，恭候您的光临」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0696", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这俩人的对话，明明那么跳跃，但却总是有进展，也真是够厉害的啊」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "「……这俩人的对话，明明那么跳跃，但却总是有进展，也真是够厉害的啊」", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0262", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实是这样。是该说安洁厉害呢、还是樱乃厉害呢。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "确实是这样。是该说安洁厉害呢、还是樱乃厉害呢。", "plain_idx": 325, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之后安洁突然转向我这边。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我回来了。早上好安洁」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，欢迎回来，新吾同学」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0697", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
