{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有什么花哨的台词，取而代之的是安洁无比喜悦的笑容和轻快的脚步。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": "没有什么花哨的台词，取而代之的是安洁无比喜悦的笑容和轻快的脚步。", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就好像是在告诉我，我不需要说什么多余的话……", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "就好像是在告诉我，我不需要说什么多余的话……", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同学，感觉今天心情如何？」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0701", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我今天心情也很好」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错，我也感觉心情愉快起来了。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为一大早就看到了心情愉快的安洁」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵……」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0702", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
