{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啦～新吾同学输掉了，要怎么办才好呢～？」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": "「啊啦～新吾同学输掉了，要怎么办才好呢～？」", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0703", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我今天心情很好所以不会在意的」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同学还真是宽容大度呢～」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0704", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像这样大家开开玩笑，心情也会越来越好。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "像这样大家开开玩笑，心情也会越来越好。", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总感觉现在的安洁，比以前更加信任我了，这一点我深有体会。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "总感觉现在的安洁，比以前更加信任我了，这一点我深有体会。", "plain_idx": 358, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么我要继续做早上的工作了。大家待会儿见～」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": "「那么我要继续做早上的工作了。大家待会儿见～」", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0705", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，加油哦，待会见」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——让人心情愉悦的地方不止是校门口。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "——让人心情愉悦的地方不止是校门口。", "plain_idx": 362, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
