{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，作为一直看着你学习的我来说，当然希望你取得一个好成绩」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "「是啊，作为一直看着你学习的我来说，当然希望你取得一个好成绩」", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3732", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜……无形的压力……」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0215", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了班级外的两人（还有一只小熊喵），今天也像这样组成了一个谈笑的小圈子。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": "除了班级外的两人（还有一只小熊喵），今天也像这样组成了一个谈笑的小圈子。", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "结女校学生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学今天也和瓜生同学他们混在一起呢……」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0053", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "结女校学生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生同学、椋梨同学，等下也来找我们说说话吧～」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0048", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到了我们这么热闹，班上的同学也向我们打着招呼。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "看到了我们这么热闹，班上的同学也向我们打着招呼。", "plain_idx": 386, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，等下就去你们那边～」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感谢邀请～」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0265", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "通用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们也是～」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "众人", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "go065", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那俩人还真是有人气啊」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3733", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，这些雄性生物有什么好的……\\n　就算是聊上天也只能让人感觉到贞操危机而已。我说得对吧？」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": "「真是的，这些雄性生物有什么好的……　就算是聊上天也只能让人感觉到贞操危机而已。我说得对吧？」", "plain_idx": 397, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0216", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵～纱纱和他们聊得那么开心～这么说可没有说服力哦」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": "「呵呵～纱纱和他们聊得那么开心～这么说可没有说服力哦」", "plain_idx": 399, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0707", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，无论是瓜生还是隼太，在和别人交流的途中都很专心，这一点很好」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "「总之，无论是瓜生还是隼太，在和别人交流的途中都很专心，这一点很好」", "plain_idx": 401, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3734", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀～啊哈哈，那是当～然」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0266", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你认为我是那样的人吗？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么一想，好像确实没怎么认真和你说过话。\\n　回到正题，那件事的后续——」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": "「这么一想，好像确实没怎么认真和你说过话。　回到正题，那件事的后续——」", "plain_idx": 407, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3735", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——没想到还真是“彻底结束”了。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": "——没想到还真是“彻底结束”了。", "plain_idx": 409, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
