{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在大家之中，敏锐地察觉到这一点的，看来只有我和安洁。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": "在大家之中，敏锐地察觉到这一点的，看来只有我和安洁。", "plain_idx": 430, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
