{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，就在刚不久。他好像是在今天之内有必须要完成的工作」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": "「是的，就在刚不久。他好像是在今天之内有必须要完成的工作」", "plain_idx": 440, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "处于特殊情况下的学生会长还真是辛苦。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
