{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的友人在不断地向着神秘生命体进化。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么说，虽然少了一个人，但大家还是在一起其乐融融地吃了午饭。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": "不管怎么说，虽然少了一个人，但大家还是在一起其乐融融地吃了午饭。", "plain_idx": 468, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家一起开庆功宴，真的好开心呀」", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0315", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我们之中，中心果然还是天羽学姐。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个人所产生的得天独厚的天然氛围，和这样悠闲的午餐时光真是太相称了。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": "这个人所产生的得天独厚的天然氛围，和这样悠闲的午餐时光真是太相称了。", "plain_idx": 472, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「非常感谢。天羽学姐都这么说的话，那我的提案就是有价值的」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": "「非常感谢。天羽学姐都这么说的话，那我的提案就是有价值的」", "plain_idx": 473, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不不，我也要感谢大家」", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0316", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小爱说过和大家一起开庆功宴是第一次对吧。其实我也是第一次」", "text_idx": 476, "plain": "「小爱说过和大家一起开庆功宴是第一次对吧。其实我也是第一次」", "plain_idx": 476, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0317", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……是这样吗」", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3739", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，所以就更开心了。对吧？」", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0318", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯……是啊……」", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3740", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，你害羞了」", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0676", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个样子的爱理是很少见的哦。美羽学姐，再多说两句！」", "text_idx": 486, "plain": "「这个样子的爱理是很少见的哦。美羽学姐，再多说两句！」", "plain_idx": 486, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0220", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你们真是够了」", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3741", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女生们对着濑名同学的反应更加热闹起来，天羽学姐笑得越来越开心了。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": "女生们对着濑名同学的反应更加热闹起来，天羽学姐笑得越来越开心了。", "plain_idx": 490, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么开心的话，总感觉就算每周都有考试也无所谓了呢」", "text_idx": 491, "plain": "「那么开心的话，总感觉就算每周都有考试也无所谓了呢」", "plain_idx": 491, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0319", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么可以说出这么可怕的话！」", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0711", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考试的话还是放过我吧……」", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0221", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，我倒是无所谓，会不会以后参加庆功宴的就只有我和学姐了呢」", "text_idx": 497, "plain": "「哦，我倒是无所谓，会不会以后参加庆功宴的就只有我和学姐了呢」", "plain_idx": 497, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3742", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是我不好～爱理～！」", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0222", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她真会报复啊。", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是还有大家能聚在一起的机会就好了」", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯♪真期待期末的到来」", "text_idx": 503, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0320", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，你们俩都很期待呢」", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3743", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「库咕咕……」", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0223", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明、明明期中考试的结果都还没出来呢……！」", "text_idx": 509, "plain": "「明、明明期中考试的结果都还没出来呢……！」", "plain_idx": 509, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0712", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在一脸天真的天羽学姐面前，纱凪和安洁被自己种下的恶果逼得越来越绝望。", "text_idx": 511, "plain": "在一脸天真的天羽学姐面前，纱凪和安洁被自己种下的恶果逼得越来越绝望。", "plain_idx": 511, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，说起来。大家听我说，今天……」", "text_idx": 512, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0321", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是，天羽学姐开始翻自己的包。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「锵～我带了曲奇哦」", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0322", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔？！是、是美羽学姐亲手做的吗？！」", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0224", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，因为妈妈有在做饼干，所以我也跟着一起做了」", "text_idx": 519, "plain": "「嗯，因为妈妈有在做饼干，所以我也跟着一起做了」", "plain_idx": 519, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0323", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想着今天大家应该也会聚在一起，所以就想带来和大家一起吃。\\n　可以的话，大家吃完饭后拿一点吧」", "text_idx": 521, "plain": "「我想着今天大家应该也会聚在一起，所以就想带来和大家一起吃。　可以的话，大家吃完饭后拿一点吧」", "plain_idx": 522, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0324", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然的啦～！！」", "text_idx": 524, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0225", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在渐渐恢复和谐的场景中——\\n（背景音：还有点心，好豪华的午餐。\\n谢谢，这是之前聊到过的那个吧。）", "text_idx": 526, "plain": "在渐渐恢复和谐的场景中——（背景音：还有点心，好豪华的午餐。谢谢，这是之前聊到过的那个吧。）", "plain_idx": 527, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜……美羽同学还是一如既往地考虑周到啊……！」", "text_idx": 528, "plain": "「呜呜……美羽同学还是一如既往地考虑周到啊……！」", "plain_idx": 528, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0713", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只有安洁一个人陷入了失败的感觉中。", "text_idx": 530, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那这样安洁，我们把茶准备好吧」", "text_idx": 531, "plain": "「……那这样安洁，我们把茶准备好吧」", "plain_idx": 531, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然说了一句。", "text_idx": 532, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——总感觉比起大家，我先注意到了安洁的反应。", "text_idx": 533, "plain": "——总感觉比起大家，我先注意到了安洁的反应。", "plain_idx": 533, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……啊……」", "text_idx": 534, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0714", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我来帮你。茶具就在那附近对吧？」", "text_idx": 536, "plain": "「我来帮你。茶具就在那附近对吧？」", "plain_idx": 536, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……是、是的！」", "text_idx": 537, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0715", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，我和新吾同学为大家沏茶。还请大家稍等一下～」", "text_idx": 539, "plain": "「那么，我和新吾同学为大家沏茶。还请大家稍等一下～」", "plain_idx": 539, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0716", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们开始吧，新吾同学」", "text_idx": 541, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0717", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁又恢复了笑容，很有精神地站了起来。", "text_idx": 543, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也跟着笑了。", "text_idx": 544, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3745", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁那个样子还真是少见」", "text_idx": 546, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3746", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
